  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/02GV">Lemma <span data-tag="02GV">29.37.16</span>.</a> A morphism is étale at a point if and only if it is flat and G-unramified at that point. A morphism is étale if and only if it is flat and G-unramified. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
